---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | CC3PO Docs";
const description = "Privacy Policy for CC3PO documentation and knowledge base. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information.";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: April 28, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Business Information</h2>
        <p><strong>CC3PO LLC</strong><br>California, United States<br>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, company name</li>
          <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, time spent, search queries</li>
          <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Browser type, device type, screen resolution, IP address</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> Session and persistent cookies for functionality and analytics</li>
          <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Messages and feedback submitted through forms or chat</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>3. AI Processing</h2>
        <p>CC3PO uses AI agents and machine learning to power search, recommendations, and documentation assistance. AI processing may involve sending anonymized data to third-party AI providers. You retain ownership of your original data.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>4. SMS Communications (Twilio)</h2>
        <p>If you provide your phone number, you may receive SMS messages from us via Twilio:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Consent:</strong> By providing your phone number, you consent to receive SMS communications</li>
          <li><strong>Frequency:</strong> Typically 1-4 messages per month</li>
          <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Reply STOP at any time to unsubscribe</li>
          <li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply HELP for assistance</li>
          <li><strong>Carrier Rates:</strong> Message and data rates may apply per your carrier</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>5. Email Marketing</h2>
        <p>If you subscribe to our newsletter:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>We store your email address securely</li>
          <li>We send documentation updates and related content</li>
          <li>We do not sell or share your email with unauthorized third parties</li>
          <li>You can unsubscribe at any time via the link in every email</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>6. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use cookies for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for site functionality and search</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Understanding how documentation is used (anonymized where possible)</li>
          <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Remembering your settings</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings. The documentation will remain accessible.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
        <table>
          <tr><th>Service</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Data Shared</th></tr>
          <tr><td>Supabase</td><td>Database and authentication</td><td>User data, session data</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Netlify</td><td>Hosting and deployment</td><td>Website traffic, form submissions</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Stripe</td><td>Payment processing</td><td>Billing information (encrypted)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Twilio</td><td>SMS and voice communications</td><td>Phone numbers, message content</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Vapi</td><td>AI voice agents</td><td>Voice call data, transcripts</td></tr>
          <tr><td>OpenAI / Anthropic</td><td>AI processing and chat</td><td>Messages (for analysis)</td></tr>
        </table>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain data for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Account data: As long as account is active, plus 2 years after closure</li>
          <li>Communications: 2 years</li>
          <li>Analytics data: 14 months</li>
          <li>Payment records: 7 years</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You may request deletion of your personal data by contacting <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a>. We will comply within 30 days.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request a copy of your data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Opt-out of analytics tracking</li>
          <li>Disable cookies in your browser</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>10. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</h2>
        <p>California residents have additional rights:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Right to know what personal information is collected</li>
          <li>Right to request deletion</li>
          <li>Right to opt-out of the sale of personal information</li>
          <li>Right to non-discrimination for exercising these rights</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>We do not sell personal information.</strong> To exercise CCPA rights, email <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a> with subject line "CCPA Request".</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>11. GDPR Compliance</h2>
        <p>For visitors from the EEA, UK, and Switzerland:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Right to Access, Rectification, Erasure, and Data Portability</li>
          <li>Right to Restrict Processing and Object to processing</li>
          <li>Right to Withdraw Consent at any time</li>
          <li>We use Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) for data transfers</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>12. Data Breach Notification</h2>
        <p>In the event of a data breach, we will notify affected users within 72 hours via email. We comply with California and GDPR breach notification requirements.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>13. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>This documentation is intended for professionals. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>14. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>15. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions about this Privacy Policy:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href="https://cc3po.com">cc3po.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
    
    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="/">← Back to Knowledge Base</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  
  p, li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  ul {
    margin-left: 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  
  th, td {
    padding: 12px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  
  th {
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
</style>